    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n80610" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πενία</span></b> , 
			Ion.
		
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-ιη</span>, ἡ, (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πένομαι</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>poverty, need</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πενίῃ εἴκων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Od.
					14.157
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οὐλομένην π</span>. <i><span class="en">
				Hes.
				<u>Op.</u>
				717
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">στάσις πενίας δότειρα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pi.
					<u>Fr.</u>
					109.5
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τῇ Ἑλλάδι π. σύντροφός ἐστι, . .
					[ἀρετῇ] δὲ διαχρεωμένη τὴν πενίην ἀπαμύνεται</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hdt.
					7.102
				</span></i>
			 ; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τῆς πτωχείας πενίαν φαμὲν εἶναι
					ἀδελφήν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ar.
					<u>Pl.</u>
					549
				</span></i>
			 ; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">π. δὲ σοφίαν ἔλαχε διὰ τὸ
				συγγενές</span> (
				v.l.
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δυστυχές</span>
			) <i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>Fr.</u>
				641
			</span></i> ; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐν πενίᾳ εἶναι,
			γίγνεσθαι</span>, <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Ap.</u>
				23c
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>R.</u>
				613a
			</span></i> ; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εἰς π. πολλὴν καὶ ἀπορίαν καταστῆναι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					And.
					1.144
				</span></i>
			 : pl. 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πενίαι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Isoc.
					8.128
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Prt.</u>
				353d
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>R.</u>
				618a
			</span></i>, etc. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>lack, need</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τινος</span>
